# EverGielinor generated world artefacts.
# A world is reproducible from its seed (./gradlew :game:generateWorld -Pseed=N),
# so the generated record and preview are not tracked. The map files the
# generator installs are tracked game data and are deliberately left alone here:
# run generateWorld to install a world, `git checkout` the data directories to
# roll back to the stock map.
ElvargServer/data/world.json
ElvargServer/data/world_config.json
